# Theme

## Source of truth
- Design tokens: `src/shared/theme/themes.ts` (`COLORS`, `DARK_COLORS`, `FONTS`, `SPACING`, `RADII`, `SHADOWS`).
- Premium skins: `src/shared/theme/themeSkins.ts` (`ThemeSkinId`, `LEGACY_THEME_ID_MAP`).
- Runtime: `useTheme()` / `useThemedStyles()` from `@theme`.
- Helpers: `withAlpha` from `@theme`.

## Adding a token
1. Add to `themes.ts` (and dark counterpart if needed)
2. Extend skin overlays in `themeSkins.ts` when skins should override it
3. Consume via `useTheme()` — never duplicate hex in components

## Color scheme
- Settings `colorScheme`: `light` | `dark` | `system`
- App config `userInterfaceStyle: 'automatic'`
